  "body": "## Summary\n- keep the implementation based exactly on the stable 2026-09-06 snapshot (`100ebca`)\n- for `VINTED_MODEL`, trust the exact category/brand/model/price result set already applied and persisted by Vinted instead of rejecting filtered rows again with the local title matcher\n- keep strict local matching and accessory filtering for `SEARCH_QUERY`\n- add per-model conversation-start counts for the current calendar week and previous full calendar week\n- read conversation starts from confirmed `FIRST_OFFER` audit records in the backend database, counting distinct marketplace listing IDs for bots matching that model\n- use Warsaw calendar windows: current week = Monday 00:00 → now; previous full week = previous Monday 00:00 → current Monday 00:00\n- expose conversation counts even when market-observer baseline is not ready, so they are independent of observer scans\n\n## Scope\nMarket offer counts retain the stable `100ebca` baseline/`firstSeenAt` semantics. No publication-time enrichment is enabled here. Normal bot session/login/worker/CAPTCHA behavior is unchanged.\n\n## Expected effect\nThe iPad targets that previously produced `matched=0` after a successfully persisted exact Vinted model filter should now seed a real baseline from the Vinted-filtered catalog. Weekly conversation counts come directly from DB audit timestamps and do not depend on those scans.",
